# Fine-Tuned Whisper Model (900MB)

The fine-tuned Whisper model is too large to be stored on GitHub (file size ~900MB).  
Download it manually from the link below and place it inside the `whisper-finetuned` folder.

### 🔽 Download the model (Google Drive)
https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=15GNsX30ibuSnIulfHJ2A2vXsnTiWLpHI

### 📂 After extracting / downloading, place the files here:
whisper-finetuned/
    model.safetensors
    config.json
    preprocessor_config.json
    tokenizer_config.json
    generation_config.json
    merges.txt
    vocab.json
    special_tokens_map.json
    normalizer.json
    added_tokens.json

Make sure your directory structure looks exactly like this before running the app.
